# Troposphere
{1160}{}{Troposphere is the great Sky Lord, praised be His name. He holds dominion over all water in the world and offers humanity a chance to be reborn into better lives, following His commandments, just like Supercell.}
{1161}{}{What makes Supercell so special?}
{1162}{}{I have another question about the religion.}
