# CultGreat
{1190}{}{Supercell was on the brink of death, and Troposphere saved him, granting him another chance at life. Supercell was recreated in the image of Troposphere and freed from the trials and worries that burden us humans. He embodies the ideals of our earthly kingdom, and we aspire to live as he does.}
{1191}{}{Okay. I have another question about the religion.}
{1192}{}{Supercell is locked up in the asylum for a reason. He's considered one of the craziest individuals in the wasteland. You're all deluded. Goodbye.}

# Beliefs1
{1220}{}{Our main belief is that there are four stages of existence. The first is the current life, the one you and I are living now. It is a time filled with challenges, but we can transcend it by following Troposphere's commandments.}
{1221}{}{[CONTINUE]}

# Beliefs2
{1250}{}{Upon death, Troposphere will reincarnate us into new lives. These lives will be far more fulfilling as we take on the image of the Great One. Once this life comes to an end, we enter the Third Life, known as the Shapeless Cloud.}

# Beliefs3
{1280}{}{During the Shapeless Cloud, we will exist in harmony, seated at the right hand of our Lord. It is a time of anticipation, as we await the fulfillment of the prophecy of Paradise. Once the fourth and final life begins, the Embodied Cloud, Troposphere will walk the earth in a corporeal form, and all of humanity will be reborn as radiant divine beings. The world will be eternaly immersed in Troposphere's love.}

# Beliefs4
{1310}{}{However, there is one condition that must be met before Troposphere's glorious return. We must perfect our respect for nature so that one born in it can truly communicate with our Lord and declare that His time has come. We strive to achieve this ultimate connection, even if it takes generations to accomplish.}
{1311}{}{Thank you. I have another question about the religion.}
{1312}{}{I want to discuss something else.}
{1313}{}{This is all nonsense. I don't have time to talk to you fanatics anymore.}

# Worship
{1340}{}{We worship by venerating and respecting all clouds and rainfall, as instructed in the Holy Weather Channel TV Guide. We also partake in joyful dances and organize festivals in the open, which allow us to hear and understand Troposphere's commandments more clearly.}
{1341}{}{Festivals? Holy Weather Channel TV Guide? Where can I obtain those?}
{1342}{}{I have another question about the religion.}

